# The repository root sets `* text=auto`, which leaves binary detection to a
# heuristic.  These files must never have their line endings rewritten — a
# "normalised" MP3 or model file is silently corrupt, and the corruption only
# shows up when something tries to decode it.  Marked explicitly rather than
# relying on the heuristic getting it right.
*.mp3  binary
*.wav  binary
*.ogg  binary
*.flac binary
*.m4a  binary
*.aiff binary
*.task binary
*.mp4  binary
*.webm binary
